# Empty on purpose: the frontend calls a RELATIVE /api/* so the Netlify edge
# function (netlify/edge-functions/api-proxy.js) can proxy to the backend AND
# strip the auth cookie's Domain — otherwise login won't persist on the
# netlify.app host. The proxy's upstream (BACKEND) is set in that edge function.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
